  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sponsor Monthly Meals for Malawi Students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide a monthly food pack to students attending public colleges in Blantyre, Malawi. These students come from vulnerable backgrounds &amp; are unable to afford tuition, boarding fees &amp; food, but are determined to secure a brighter future for their country through education. Sponsorships are available for tuition &amp; boarding fees, but there isn&apos;t support for the provision of food - this is where Gift of the Givers bridges the gap for Malawi&apos;s youth, &amp; future leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
